{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "core",
 "version": "0.3",
 "title": "core",
 "description": "The boot copier and the hook bus for Model:Cycles: every other mod needs it. From 0.2 it also exports the firmware locations mods use (fw_*), and from 0.3 it calls ev_boot once at boot, before the OS starts. On its own it changes nothing the unit does.",
